# Terraform
.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.backup
*.tfstate.*
!*.tfstate.example
crash.log
crash.*.log
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json
# Local / secret overrides — never commit.
# NOTE: environments/dev/global.tfvars is intentionally TRACKED shared dev
# config. Keep secrets out of it; put personal or sensitive values in a
# gitignored terraform.tfvars instead.
terraform.tfvars
!terraform.tfvars.example
tfplan
tfplan.*
*.out

